{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object; if found, move to it, take it, check properties, and do specific task. Otherwise, scan area or move.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <Action ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
